   *
   * @param connection
   * @param productId UUID of the target product to which the new variant will be added.
   * @param body Variant creation payload containing the unique SKU code, optional price override, and option key-value pairs defining the variant's configuration.
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor seller
