   * @param productId The unique identifier (UUID) of the parent product whose variant is being deleted. Used to verify the variant belongs to the correct product and for authorization (seller must own this product).
   * @param variantId The unique identifier (UUID) of the product variant to delete. Must belong to the product specified by productId.
