   * @x-autobe-specification Query e_commerce_mall_orders table filtered by the authenticated customer's ID (e_commerce_mall_customer_id). Apply optional status filter by computing the derived order status from order items at query time - join with e_commerce_mall_order_items and aggregate statuses per order. Apply sorting by created_at descending (newest first). Implement cursor-based or offset pagination as configured. Return paginated summary records with order code, created_at, total_price, and the computed overall status. Edge case: if status filter is provided, pre-filter orders by checking order item statuses before pagination.
